  "content": "<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/714/118/mighty_mail_banner.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1100\" height=\"270\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffiles.minecraftforge.net%252fnet%252fminecraftforge%252fforge%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/793/502/_x__xampp_htdocs_mrcrayfish.png\" alt=\"Forge\" width=\"99\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/793/503/_x__xampp_htdocs_mrcrayfish.png\" alt=\"Fabric\" width=\"105\" height=\"28\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/framework\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/793/504/mrcrayfish.png\" alt=\"需要 Framework\" width=\"222\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.mrcrayfish.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/793/500/_x__xampp_htdocs_mrcrayfish.png\" alt=\"MrCrayfish 的網站\" width=\"117\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/MrCrayfishMinecraft\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/793/499/_x__xampp_htdocs_mrcrayfish.png\" alt=\"MrCrayfish 的 YouTube\" width=\"119\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/mrcrayfish\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/336389026586165261?label=&amp;color=2d2d2d&amp;labelColor=dddddd&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=Discord&amp;logoColor=902121\" alt=\"MrCrayfish 的 Discord\"></a></p><h5>📖 <strong>關於</strong></h5><p>Mighty Mail 是即將翻新的 MrCrayfish 家具模組中郵件系統的獨立版本。這個郵件系統用途廣泛，值得擁有自己的模組。這樣你就不必為了使用這項超棒功能而安裝整個裝飾模組。在這個模組中，你會發現每種木材種類都有郵筒和信箱。郵筒讓你能夠將郵件寄送給伺服器上的其他玩家。你可以將物品以及選擇性的訊息放入世界中的任何信箱。它也能跨維度運作。當你收到郵件時，你的信箱會出現一面小紅旗。為了客製化你的體驗，還有設定選項可以調整信箱的庫存大小以及增加最大投遞佇列限制。</p><h5>🎨 <strong>截圖</strong></h5><p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/714/131/screenshot1-1.png\" width=\"1125\" height=\"633\"></strong></p><p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/714/132/screenshot2-1.png\" width=\"1125\" height=\"633\"></strong></p><p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/714/133/screenshot3-1.png\" width=\"1125\" height=\"632\"></strong></p>",
